      "type": "text",
      "x": 465, "y": 270, "width": 350, "height": 180,
      "text": "Kanban (drag and drop de leads)\nTabela paginada + busca\nFicha lateral do lead\n\nFerramentas:\n• dnd-kit (drag and drop) ...... $0\n• TanStack Table (tabelas) ..... $0\n• TanStack Virtual (10k+ rows). $0\n• React Hook Form .............. $0",
