      "type": "text",
      "x": 55, "y": 530, "width": 350, "height": 180,
      "text": "Cadastro de sites clientes\nGerador de chaves (exibe 1x só)\nConstrutor visual de snippets\nStatus heartbeat (ativo/inativo)\n\nFerramentas:\n• crypto (Go stdlib) ........... $0\n• go-jwt (tokens) .............. $0\n• Prism.js (syntax highlight) . $0\n• nanoid (IDs curtos) .......... $0",
