      "type": "text",
      "x": 465, "y": 530, "width": 350, "height": 180,
      "text": "Editor WYSIWYG (tipo Notion)\nUpload de imagens (WebP auto)\nRascunho / Publicado\nSlug automatico para SEO\n\nFerramentas:\n• Tiptap (editor rich text) .... $0\n• imaging (Go, resize/WebP) ... $0\n• slugify ...................... $0\n• Storage (VPS local) .......... $0",
